          "title": "Invalid Zip Code Feedback",
          "story": "As a user, I want to get feedback when I enter an invalid zip code.",
          "acceptance_criteria": []
        },
        {
          "title": "Access Site on All Devices",
          "story": "As a user, I want to be able to access the site and do all the other stuff on all of my electronic devices.",
          "acceptance_criteria": []
        },
        {
          "title": "Great UI and UX",
          "story": "As a user, I want to have a great UI and UX from the sites, so that I have a pleasant experience when navigating through them.",
          "acceptance_criteria": []
        },
        {
          "title": "Easy Website Navigation",
          "story": "As a company, I want to have a website that is easy to use, so that I can upload or delete stuff step by step.",
          "acceptance_criteria": []
        },
        {
          "title": "UI/UX Lessons for Developers",
          "story": "As a developer, I want to attend some UI/UX lessons, so that I can develop an awesome and beautiful features website.",
          "acceptance_criteria": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
